## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical DR planning with common AWS services and ensures candidates know backup, cross-region replication, lifecycle, and cost controls.

## Key Concepts
- RDS PITR, snapshot copy across regions
- S3 lifecycle and Glacier integration
- AWS Budgets for DR cost visibility
- Recovery testing and IAM least privilege

## Code Example
```javascript
// Node.js snippet to copy an RDS snapshot to a DR region
const AWS = require('aws-sdk');
const src = new AWS.RDS({ region: 'us-east-1' });
const dst = new AWS.RDS({ region: 'us-west-2' });
async function copySnapshot(sourceArn, targetId) {
  return dst.copyDBSnapshot({ SourceDBSnapshotIdentifier: sourceArn, TargetDBSnapshotIdentifier: targetId }).promise();
}
```

